    "stdout": "commit 5d94ef8d8da18b636279553ed037b906259b2882\nAuthor:     Duncan McGreggor <oubiwann@gmail.com>\nAuthorDate: Mon Sep 21 13:09:26 2026 -0500\nCommit:     Duncan McGreggor <oubiwann@gmail.com>\nCommitDate: Mon Sep 21 13:09:26 2026 -0500\n\n    docs(project01): add CC portable contract correction evidence\n    \n    Add the sealed CC correction packet for Slice02, including the richer 117-field\n    inventory, fail-closed capture/verify driver, raw query log, replay result, and\n    manifest. The packet remains proposed-done pending CDC review and Operator\n    acceptance.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n    Co-authored-by: Billo AI <ai-engineering@billo.systems>\n\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/SHA256SUMS             |    6 +\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/execution.log          | 5383 +++++++++++++++++\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/intake.md              |  107 +\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/nested-fields.json     | 6031 ++++++++++++++++++++\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/replay-result.json     | 1345 +++++\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/replay.py              |  492 ++\n .../artifacts/cc-evidence02/report.md              |  125 +\n 7 files changed, 13489 insertions(+)\n",
